    "From then on, whenever StandBy turns on, the sign is there. No need to open the app." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "之后每次进入待机显示，状态牌都会在那里，无需打开 App。"
